{"id":"49fccdf1ada96726","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-geology-bedrock-model.md","title":"ZFC Geology Bedrock Model","display":"df-zfc-geology-bedrock-model — ZFC Geology Bedrock Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-geology-bedrock-model","aliases":["58-df-zfc-geology-bedrock-model"],"display":"df-zfc-geology-bedrock-model — ZFC Geology Bedrock Model","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-geology-bedrock-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-geology-bedrock-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-geology-bedrock-model — ZFC Geology Bedrock Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0244462250ae67e\" href=\"?note=d0244462250ae67e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ground.md\">../batch06/58-df-ground.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf V,W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(\\mathbf V,W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}^2\">\\(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d0244462250ae67e\" href=\"?note=d0244462250ae67e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ground.md\">../batch06/58-df-ground.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyBedrockModel}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyBedrockModel}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}geology\\text{-}bedrock\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyBedrockModel}_S(W)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,\\mathbf V)\\land\\neg\\exists U\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\;\\bigl(U\\neq W\\land\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(U,W)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}geology\\text{-}bedrock\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyBedrockModel}_S(W)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,\\mathbf V)\\land\\neg\\exists U\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\;\\bigl(U\\neq W\\land\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(U,W)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A bedrock is a ground of the universe having no proper forcing ground of its own.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ground.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0244462250ae67e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ground.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0244462250ae67e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}^2$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf V,W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyBedrockModel}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}geology\\text{-}bedrock\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyBedrockModel}_S(W)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,\\mathbf V)\\land\\neg\\exists U\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\;\\bigl(U\\neq W\\land\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(U,W)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":887,"backlinks":[{"id":"84